## Interface: 16001
## Title: Better Forever
## Notes: Small fixes for the WoW Forever client: FPS counter kept on screen, creature types in tooltips and on nameplates, combo points on the target's nameplate, a wand indicator, a Soul Shard reaper for warlocks and a Cinematic Ultra graphics switch. Options under AddOns > Better Forever, or /bb and /bf.
